Subject: [PATCH] Wild Pokemon in Johto's side areas in line with the main path

After johto_wild.py some optional areas sat well below the route beside
them: the Ruins of Alph's chambers at Lv. 5, the Bell Tower at 23-28 and
the Whirl Islands at 25-29, Route 45 and Dark Cave's Route 45 side at
23-31. Each is tied to the boss a player faces next when going there
(Bugsy, Clair, the rival on Victory Road) and moves into the same band,
75-85% of that boss's average. Generated by tools/hack/side_wild.py.
